        </p>
        
        <div class="pt-4 animate-fade-in-up delay-200">
          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4 justify-center md:justify-start animate-float md:!animate-none">

            <a href="/contact" class="px-8 py-4 bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-600 to-cyan-500 hover:from-blue-500 hover:to-cyan-400 text-white rounded-lg font-bold transition-all shadow-lg shadow-blue-900/50 hover:shadow-blue-900/80 hover:-translate-y-1">
              無料で相談する
            </a>
            <a href="/works" class="px-8 py-4 bg-white/5 border border-white/20 hover:bg-white/10 hover:border-white/40 text-white rounded-lg font-bold transition-all backdrop-blur-sm hover:-translate-y-1">
              実績を見る
            </a>

          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="relative animate-float hidden md:block">

        {/* ローカルAIの対話デモ（タイプ演出はスクリプトで実装） */}
        <div class="relative z-10 rounded-2xl bg-slate-950 border border-slate-700 shadow-2xl shadow-blue-900/40 ring-1 ring-cyan-500/20 overflow-hidden font-mono text-sm">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-3 bg-slate-800/80 border-b border-slate-700">
            <span class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-red-400/80"></span>
            <span class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-amber-400/80"></span>
            <span class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-emerald-400/80"></span>
            <span class="ml-3 text-slate-400 text-xs">local-ai — このPCの中だけで動作中</span>
            <span class="ml-auto inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[10px] font-bold text-emerald-400 tracking-wider">
